# Figures rewritten by every run (journal entry 9); a fresh clone rebuilds
# them: 05 (km_risk_groups.pdf, c_index_stability.pdf), 13 (cbx5/),
# 14 (sign_bias/) and 15 (external_validation/). archive/ stays tracked.
03_figures/*
!03_figures/archive/
