# run manifests of 02 and 07 (G13), rewritten by every run
01_processed_data/run_manifest_*.txt
# R data saves and session/editor artefacts, in any directory (G10): never
# tracked. The extension rules match any letter case, so they also hold on
# case-sensitive (Linux/WSL) checkouts. Every .rds is derived or downloaded by
# the pipeline; to commit one on purpose (e.g. a fixture), add a ! exception.
*.[Rr][Dd][Ss]
*.[Rr][Dd][Aa][Tt][Aa]
*.[Rr][Dd][Aa]
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.vscode/
.Ruserdata/
.httr-oauth
.DS_Store
